# AI-Wrapper root .gitignore
#
# This root repository tracks shared governance documentation only
# (CLAUDE.md, ARCHITECTURE.md, .claude/). Every subproject folder below
# is meant to become its own independent Git repository, exactly like
# each product repo in the workspace this template was extracted from.
#
# Rename backend/ and frontend/ to your real project names as you set
# them up, and add each one's real name here as you go — the entries
# below are the two starter placeholders this template ships with.

backend/
frontend/

# When you add a third subproject folder (see .claude/skills/05-project-level-skills.md
# for when a project deserves its own skills folder), add its path here too:
# service-name/
